@namespace Lumeo.Docs.Shared.Showcases
@* Static exception (see ../README.md): CodeEditor mounts CodeMirror 6 via a dynamically-
   imported JS module with on-demand language packs — a heavy JS engine that needs a real
   browser runtime to initialize, not something a catalog card should bootstrap. This
   renders a faithful static rendition of the editor chrome (language pill, line gutter,
   syntax-colored lines) using theme tokens only, without mounting CodeMirror. *@

